60 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (One of our regular monthly contributors recently shared the reason behind his continued support for Arike.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
61 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (His elderly mother developed severe constipation, abdominal discomfort and bloating. Concerned about her condition, the family took her to hospital. After several days of investigations and treatment, she was discharged with a very high hospital bill. As a family that depended on daily wage work, the financial burden was overwhelming.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
62 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (When the same symptoms returned a few days later, an ASHA worker suggested that they can contact Arike. Our home care team visited the patient, assessed her condition, and managed her chronic constipation with enema at home. She experienced significant relief and recovered comfortably without another hospital admission. Reflecting on the experience, he said: "Until I contacted Arike, I never knew this could be managed at home. We thought going to the hospital was our only option.")
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
63 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
64 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (His words echo the sentiments of many of our regular contributors. Some give out of gratitude for the care their loved ones received, while others contribute because they believe compassionate home-based palliative care should always be available to every family. Every contribution, no matter the amount, helps ensure that Arike can continue bringing quality care, comfort, and dignity to patients in their own homes.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
