<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (On July 5, 2026, Team Koode conducted a sensitization programme at the Thanal Residents Association, Vaduthala. Mr. Donal and Mr. Suhail introduced the Koode project, Arike, and the principles of community-based palliative care. The session emphasized the role of residents' associations in building compassionate communities and supporting individuals living with serious illnesses.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
